{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_119_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_119","textTraditional":"一、五年，春，公如齊。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_119_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_119","textTraditional":"二、夏，公至自齊。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_119_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_119","textTraditional":"三、秋九月，齊高固來逆子叔姬。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_119_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_119","textTraditional":"四、叔孫得臣卒。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_119_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_119","textTraditional":"五、冬，齊高固及子叔姬來。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_119_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_119","textTraditional":"何言乎高固之來？言叔姬之來，而不言高固之來則不可。子公羊子曰：「其諸為其雙雙而俱至者與。」","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_119_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_119","textTraditional":"六、楚人伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":7}],"overrides":{}}